0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 62 547 Td (- The signup service checks for an existing email, hashes the password, and asks) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 62 533 Td (- UserRepository to create the account.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 62 517 Td (- UserRepository uses Drizzle to query or insert a row in the PostgreSQL users table.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 62 501 Td (- The response travels back to the client with an HTTP status such as 201 or 400.) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
