0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 62 281 Td (- The successful request wrote an account into the database. Keep that in mind; do not delete) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 62 267 Td (- or reset the database to continue the lesson.) Tj ET
